Neovim Tutor: 02 EDITING

Goal
  Learn delete/change/yank/paste and repeat.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 1: Delete and change
  x     delete char under cursor
  dw    delete word
  dd    delete line
  cw    change word (delete + insert)

Practice:
  - Use cw to change words in this paragraph.
  - Use dw to delete a word, then undo.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 2: Yank and paste
  yy    yank line
  p     paste after cursor
  P     paste before cursor

Practice:
  - Yank a line with yy and paste it with p.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 3: Repeat and count
  .     repeat last change
  3dd   delete 3 lines
  5w    move 5 words forward

Practice:
  - Do a small change, then press . to repeat it.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 4: Replace
  r{char} replace one char
  R       replace mode

Practice:
  - Use r to replace a character.
  - Try R to replace text, then <Esc>.

End of lesson 02.
